#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<ip> [ I<OPTIONS> ] B<neigh> { I<COMMAND> | B<help> }"
msgstr "B<ip> [ I<OPTIONS> ] B<neigh> { I<COMMANDE> | B<help> }"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<ip neigh> { B<add> | B<del> | B<change> | B<replace> } { I<ADDR> "
"[ B<lladdr> I<LLADDR> ] [ B<nud> I<STATE> ] | B<proxy> I<ADDR> } [ B<dev> "
"I<DEV> ] [ B<router> ] [ B<use> ] [ B<managed> ] [ B<extern_learn> ]"
msgstr ""
"B<ip neigh> { B<add> | B<del> | B<change> | B<replace> } { I<ADRESSE> "
"[ B<lladdr> I<ADRESSE_CL> ] [ B<nud> I<ÉTAT> ] | B<proxy> I<ADRESSE> } "
"[ B<dev> I<PÉRIPH> ] [ B<router> ] [ B<use> ] [ B<managed> ] "
"[ B<extern_learn> ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<ip neigh> { B<show> | B<flush> } [ B<proxy> ] [ B<to> I<PREFIX> ] [ B<dev> "
"I<DEV> ] [ B<nud> I<STATE> ] [ B<vrf> I<NAME> ] [ B<nomaster> ]"
msgstr ""
"B<ip neigh> { B<show> | B<flush> } [ B<proxy> ] [ B<to> I<PRÉFIXE> ] "
"[ B<dev> I<PÉRIPH> ] [ B<nud> I<ÉTAT> ] [ B<vrf> I<NOM> ] [ B<nomaster> ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<ip neigh get> I<ADDR> B<dev> I<DEV>"
msgstr "B<ip neigh get> I<ADRESSE> B<dev> I<PÉRIPH>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"I<STATE> := { B<permanent> | B<noarp> | B<stale> | B<reachable> | B<none> | "
"B<incomplete> | B<delay> | B<probe> | B<failed> }"
msgstr ""
"I<ÉTAT> : = { B<permanent> | B<noarp> | B<stale> | B<reachable> | B<none> | "
"B<incomplete> | B<delay> | B<probe> | B<failed> }"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<ip neigh> command manipulates I<neighbour> objects that establish "
"bindings between protocol addresses and link layer addresses for hosts "
"sharing the same link.  Neighbour entries are organized into tables. The "
"IPv4 neighbour table is also known by another name - the ARP table."
msgstr ""
"La commande B<ip neigh> manipule les objets I<neighbour> qui établissent des "
"liens entre les adresses avec protocole et les adresses de la couche de "
"liaison pour les hôtes partageant la même liaison. Les entrées neighbour "
"sont organisées en tables. La table neighbour IPv4 est aussi connue sous le "
"nom de table ARP."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The corresponding commands display neighbour bindings and their properties, "
"add new neighbour entries and delete old ones."
msgstr ""
"Les commandes suivantes affichent les liaisons neighbour et leurs "
"propriétés, ajoutent de nouvelles entrées neighbour et suppriment les "
"anciennes."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neighbour add"
msgstr "ip neighbour add"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "add a new neighbour entry"
msgstr "ajouter une nouvelle entrée neighbour."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neighbour change"
msgstr "ip neighbour change"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "change an existing entry"
msgstr "changer une entrée existante."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neighbour replace"
msgstr "ip neighbour replace"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "add a new entry or change an existing one"
msgstr "ajouter une nouvelle entrée ou changer une existante."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "These commands create new neighbour records or update existing ones."
msgstr ""
"Ces commandes créent de nouveaux enregistrements neighbour ou mettent à jour "
"ceux existants."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<to>I< ADDRESS >B<(default)>"
msgstr "B<to>I< ADRESSE >B<(default)>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"the protocol address of the neighbour. It is either an IPv4 or IPv6 address."
msgstr "l'adresse avec protocole du neighbour ; une adresse IPv4 ou IPv6."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<dev>I< NAME>"
msgstr "B<dev>I< NOM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "the interface to which this neighbour is attached."
msgstr "l'interface à laquelle ce neighbour est attaché."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<proxy>"
msgstr "B<proxy>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "indicates whether we are proxying for this neighbour entry"
msgstr "indiquer si un mandataire est utilisé pour cette entrée de neighbour."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<router>"
msgstr "B<router>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "indicates whether neighbour is a router"
msgstr "indiquer si neighbour est un routeur."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<use>"
msgstr "B<use>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"this neigh entry is in \"use\". This option can be used to indicate to the "
"kernel that a controller is using this dynamic entry. If the entry does not "
"exist, the kernel will resolve it. If it exists, an attempt to refresh the "
"neighbor entry will be triggered."
msgstr ""
"cette entrée neighbour est « utilisée ». Cette option peut être utilisée "
"pour indiquer au noyau qu'un contrôleur utilise cette entrée dynamique. Si "
"l'entrée n'existe pas, le noyau la résoudra. Si elle existe, une tentative "
"de rafraîchissement de l'entrée neighbour sera déclenchée."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<managed>"
msgstr "B<managed>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"this neigh entry is \"managed\". This option can be used to indicate to the "
"kernel that a controller is using this dynamic entry. In contrast to "
"\"use\", if the entry does not exist, the kernel will resolve it and "
"periodically attempt to auto-refresh the neighbor entry such that it remains "
"in resolved state when possible."
msgstr ""
"cette entrée neighbour est « gérée ». Cette option peut être utilisée pour "
"indiquer au noyau qu'un contrôleur utilise cette entrée dynamique. Au "
"contraire de « use », si l'entrée n'existe pas, le noyau la résoudra et "
"essaiera périodiquement d'auto-rafraîchir l'entrée neighbour pour qu'elle "
"reste dans un état résolu lorsque c’est possible."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<extern_learn>"
msgstr "B<extern_learn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"this neigh entry was learned externally. This option can be used to indicate "
"to the kernel that this is a controller learnt dynamic entry.  Kernel will "
"not gc such an entry."
msgstr ""
"l’entrée neighbour a été résolue extérieurement. Cette option peut être "
"utilisée pour indiquer au noyau qu'un contrôleur a résolu l'entrée "
"dynamique. Le noyau n’utilisera pas le ramasse-miettes pour une telle entrée."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<lladdr>I< LLADDRESS>"
msgstr "B<lladdr>I< ADRESSE_CL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"the link layer address of the neighbour.  I<LLADDRESS> can also be B<null>."
msgstr ""
"l'adresse de la couche liaison du neighbour. I<ADRESSE_CL> peut aussi être "
"B<null>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<nud>I< STATE>"
msgstr "B<nud>I< ÉTAT>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"the state of the neighbour entry.  B<nud> is an abbreviation for 'Neighbour "
"Unreachability Detection'.  The state can take one of the following values:"
msgstr ""
"l'état de l'entrée neighbour. B<nud> est une abréviation de « Neighbour "
"Unreachability Detection ». L'état peut prendre l'une des valeurs suivantes :"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<permanent>"
msgstr "B<permanent>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"the neighbour entry is valid forever and can be only be removed "
"administratively."
msgstr ""
"l'entrée neighbour est valable pour toujours et ne peut être supprimée "
"qu'administrativement."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<noarp>"
msgstr "B<noarp>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"the neighbour entry is valid. No attempts to validate this entry will be "
"made but it can be removed when its lifetime expires."
msgstr ""
"l'entrée neighbour est valable. Aucune tentative pour valider cette entrée "
"ne sera effectuée, mais elle peut être supprimée lors de l'expiration de sa "
"durée de vie."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<reachable>"
msgstr "B<reachable>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "the neighbour entry is valid until the reachability timeout expires."
msgstr ""
"l'entrée neighbour est valable jusqu'à l'expiration du délai d'accessibilité."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<stale>"
msgstr "B<stale>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"the neighbour entry is valid but suspicious.  This option to B<ip neigh> "
"does not change the neighbour state if it was valid and the address is not "
"changed by this command."
msgstr ""
"l'entrée neighbour est valable mais suspecte. Cette option de B<ip neigh> ne "
"change pas l'état du neighbour s'il était valable, et l'adresse n'est pas "
"changée par cette commande."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<none>"
msgstr "B<none>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"this is a pseudo state used when initially creating a neighbour entry or "
"after trying to remove it before it becomes free to do so."
msgstr ""
"pseudo-état utilisé lors de la création initiale d'une entrée neighbour ou "
"après avoir essayé de la supprimer avant qu’elle ne devienne libre pour "
"pouvoir le faire."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<incomplete>"
msgstr "B<incomplete>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "the neighbour entry has not (yet) been validated/resolved."
msgstr "l'entrée neighbour n'a pas encore été validée/résolue."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<delay>"
msgstr "B<delay>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "neighbor entry validation is currently delayed."
msgstr "la validation de l'entrée neighbour est actuellement différée."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<probe>"
msgstr "B<probe>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "neighbor is being probed."
msgstr "le neighbour est en cours d’examen."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<failed>"
msgstr "B<failed>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"max number of probes exceeded without success, neighbor validation has "
"ultimately failed."
msgstr ""
"le nombre maximal d’examens essayés sans succès, au bout desquels la "
"validation a finalement échoué."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neighbour delete"
msgstr "ip neighbour delete"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "delete a neighbour entry"
msgstr "effacer une entrée neighbour."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The arguments are the same as with B<ip neigh add>, except that B<lladdr> "
"and B<nud> are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Les arguments sont les mêmes qu'avec B<ip neigh add>, sauf que B<lladdr> et "
"B<nud> sont ignorés."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<Warning:> Attempts to delete or manually change a B<noarp> entry created "
"by the kernel may result in unpredictable behaviour.  Particularly, the "
"kernel may try to resolve this address even on a B<NOARP> interface or if "
"the address is multicast or broadcast."
msgstr ""
"B<ATTENTION> : les tentatives d'effacer ou de changer manuellement une "
"entrée B<noarp> créée par le noyau peuvent conduire à des comportements "
"inattendus. En particulier, le noyau peut essayer de résoudre cette adresse "
"même sur une interface B<NOARP> ou si l'adresse est « multicast » ou "
"« broadcast »."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neighbour show"
msgstr "ip neighbour show"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "list neighbour entries"
msgstr "liste des entrées neighbour."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "the prefix selecting the neighbours to list."
msgstr "le préfixe sélectionnant les neighbour à lister."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "only list the neighbours attached to this device."
msgstr "ne lister que les neighbour attachés à ce périphérique."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<vrf>I< NAME>"
msgstr "B<vrf>I< NOM>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "only list the neighbours for given VRF."
msgstr "ne lister que les neighbour pour un VRF donné."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<nomaster>"
msgstr "B<nomaster>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "only list neighbours attached to an interface with no master."
msgstr "ne lister que les neighbour attachés à une interface sans maître."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "list neighbour proxies."
msgstr "liste des mandataires de neighbour."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<unused>"
msgstr "B<unused>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "only list neighbours which are not currently in use."
msgstr "ne lister que les neighbour qui ne sont pas utilisés actuellement."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"only list neighbour entries in this state.  I<NUD_STATE> takes values listed "
"below or the special value B<all> which means all states. This option may "
"occur more than once.  If this option is absent, B<ip> lists all entries "
"except for B<none> and B<noarp>."
msgstr ""
"ne lister que les entrées neighbour dans cet état. I<NUD_ÉTAT> prend les "
"valeurs listées ci-dessous ou la valeur spéciale B<all> qui signifie tous "
"les états. Cette option peut apparaître plusieurs fois. Si cette option est "
"absente, B<ip> listera toutes les entrées excepté pour B<none> et B<noarp>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neighbour flush"
msgstr "ip neighbour flush"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "flush neighbour entries"
msgstr "vider les entrées neighbour."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"This command has the same arguments as B<show.> The differences are that it "
"does not run when no arguments are given, and that the default neighbour "
"states to be flushed do not include B<permanent> and B<noarp>."
msgstr ""
"Cette commande prend les mêmes arguments que B<show>. Les différences sont "
"qu’elle ne fonctionne pas si aucun argument n'est donné et que les états "
"neighbour par défaut à vider n'incluent pas B<permanent> et B<noarp>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"With the B<-statistics> option, the command becomes verbose. It prints out "
"the number of deleted neighbours and the number of rounds made to flush the "
"neighbour table. If the option is given twice, B<ip neigh flush> also dumps "
"all the deleted neighbours."
msgstr ""
"Avec l'option B<-statistics>, la commande devient prolixe. Elle affiche le "
"nombre de neighbour effacés et le nombre de tours effectués pour vider la "
"table neighbour. Si l'option est donnée deux fois, B<ip neigh flush> vide "
"aussi les neighbour effacés."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip neigh get"
msgstr "ip neigh get"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "lookup a neighbour entry to a destination given a device"
msgstr ""
"recherche d'une entrée neighbour pour une destination et pour un "
"périphérique donné."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "indicates whether we should lookup a proxy neighbour entry"
msgstr "indiquer si on doit chercher une entrée neighbour mandataire."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "the prefix selecting the neighbour to query."
msgstr "le préfixe sélectionnant le neighbour à demander."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "get neighbour entry attached to this device."
msgstr "obtenir l'entrée neighbour attachée à ce périphérique."

